  "review": {
    "scope": "The 0.2.0 and 0.3.0 releases remain historical. Version 0.4.0 adds the experimental communication-language SDK and standard-library A2A JSON-RPC client while preserving the v2 gesture/event contract. M0-M4 and MI-01 through MI-10 are verified for the exact 0.4.0 release candidate. No human/cultural/accessibility validation, field accuracy, camera adapter or live production-host integration is claimed.",
    "baseline_tests": "Historical source tree 981aec9c had M0 23/23, M1 120/120, M2 165/165 with 15 mutations, MI-01 through MI-09, 8/8 MI-08 platform cells (run 37716341667), and M3 187/187 with 83/83 IDs (run 37717500467). These receipts are retained as historical evidence, not current-source verification. The tracked proposal, review contract and required repairs change source identity.",
    "verification_claim": "The exact 0.4.0 release from source 875a611 is published and its artifacts, attestations, downloaded installs and GitHub release are verified. README/changelog status corrections form a documentation-only post-release source tree (9f3055). M0-M2 have been freshly requalified on that tree; current M3 platform and full-gate receipts are being refreshed. The published M4 proof remains correctly bound to the immutable 875a611 release candidate. No human/cultural/accessibility validation or production-host integration is claimed.",
    "review_kind": "astra_technical_model_review",
    "review_document": "docs/ASTRA_REVIEW_2026-10-08.md",
